'''Akaza Strikes!''' (強襲！猗窩座との戦い, ''Kyōshū! Akaza tono Tatakai'', '''Assault! Battle Against Akaza''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that was added in [[Version 15.1 Update#Version 15.1.1|Version 15.1.1]] for [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] and in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]] for [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].

==Overview==
===About===
Akaza Strikes! contains a total of 20 stages. After beating 3 stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards and gauntlet progress reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Akaza Strikes!/Why Not Become a Demon? Lv.1~20]]''

